    "detailed_description": "<h1>Community Special</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528080/extras/903ec98beb34178a340b465e737092bb.poster.avif?t=1721835228\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528080/extras/903ec98beb34178a340b465e737092bb.webm?t=1721835228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528080/extras/903ec98beb34178a340b465e737092bb.mp4?t=1721835228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>While everything was going smoothly in the town of &quot;West&quot;, a gang of escapees from a distant prison rolled into town by train. <br><br>You must stop the bandits and rescue the town! <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528080/extras/588d5b88bdd6c68c7b7cf9180a423e55.avif?t=1721835228\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528080/extras/016782d8068e0e288f1fc89ea595bb17.avif?t=1721835228\" /></span><br><br>Watch out! <br><br>Gunslingers and bandits are storming the town, but don't panic! <br>With your quick reflexes and sharp wit, you can overcome this disaster and make the town safe again.<br><br>Get ready, put on your boots, and join this Western action! Packed with pleasant graphics, immersive sounds, and atmosphere that will take you straight to the heart of the action, this game is not just ordinary fun\u2014it's an adventure!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528080/extras/903ec98beb34178a340b465e737092bb.poster.avif?t=1721835228\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528080/extras/903ec98beb34178a340b465e737092bb.webm?t=1721835228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528080/extras/903ec98beb34178a340b465e737092bb.mp4?t=1721835228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>While everything was going smoothly in the town of &quot;West&quot;, a gang of escapees from a distant prison rolled into town by train. <br><br>You must stop the bandits and rescue the town! <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528080/extras/588d5b88bdd6c68c7b7cf9180a423e55.avif?t=1721835228\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528080/extras/016782d8068e0e288f1fc89ea595bb17.avif?t=1721835228\" /></span><br><br>Watch out! <br><br>Gunslingers and bandits are storming the town, but don't panic! <br>With your quick reflexes and sharp wit, you can overcome this disaster and make the town safe again.<br><br>Get ready, put on your boots, and join this Western action! Packed with pleasant graphics, immersive sounds, and atmosphere that will take you straight to the heart of the action, this game is not just ordinary fun\u2014it's an adventure!",
    "short_description": "You must stop the bandits and rescue the town! This is a tough mission Sheriff, be careful. West Town Defense is a wave based survival game with hardcore FPS Shooter elements.",
